IMPORTANT — third-party data:
The workshop loader points to the Copenhagen Ugaritic Corpus (CACCHT project,
DT-UCPH/cuc), mirrored at HuggingFace (`AlexWalhai/cuc`). 
CUC is NOT covered by this repository's license.

Other primary data (UDB, tablet photographs, museum catalogue entries, etc.) likewise remains under the terms of its
original provider. See data/README.md before redistributing any corpus material.

The code-only UDB parser under `workshop_tools/` is covered by the MIT above. 
That code license does not license the UDB source work, a
participant-supplied PDF, or any generated database.
